WEBVTT

00:32:26.918 --> 00:32:30.998
bili su interesi javnosti

00:32:30.998 --> 00:32:33.941
i principi koji su temelj

00:32:33.941 --> 00:32:37.217
novinarstva u SAD-u

00:32:37.217 --> 00:32:39.663
i diljem svijeta,

00:32:39.663 --> 00:32:44.508
i smatram da, ako mediji govore

00:32:44.508 --> 00:32:46.590
da to podupiru,

00:32:46.590 --> 00:32:48.678
da se to mora dogoditi,

00:32:48.678 --> 00:32:51.322
to je onda moćan argument,
no ne i finalni argument.

00:32:51.322 --> 00:32:54.035
Mislim da bi o tome trebala odlučiti javnost.

00:32:54.035 --> 00:32:55.877
No, istovremeno

00:32:55.877 --> 00:32:57.423
vlada je nagovijestila da želi

00:32:57.423 --> 00:32:59.267
nekakav dogovor,

00:32:59.267 --> 00:33:01.381
da želi da otkrijem